  "description": "dotnet new template for SmartTableSync: an Azure Function that syncs tables from a parent to a child Azure SQL database, with a script and Terraform that deploy it and start the first sync. Install with \"dotnet new install SmartTableSync.Templates\", then create a project with \"dotnet new smarttablesync-azure\".",
